#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rover-commands.rst:29
#: 1c175d4d46d24799b345dbaec2bd7d8b
msgid ""
"Set the vehicle's target position (as an offset in NED from the EKF origin),"
" velocity, heading or turn rate.  The message definition can be found `here "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED>`__"
msgstr ""
"设置飞行器的目标位置（相对 EKF 原点的 NED 偏移量）、速度、航向或转弯速率。消息定义见 `此处 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED>`__。"

