"POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK enum)"
msgstr "位掩码，用于指示飞行器应 **忽略** 哪些字段（见 POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK 枚举）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rover-commands.rst:61
#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rover-commands.rst:266
#: d4ee4a6903924f7380d5593ae4120773 e30f3f8497b04fe1957d0781f35dd31d
msgid ""
"bit1:PosX, bit2:PosY, bit3:PosZ, bit4:VelX, bit5:VelY, bit6:VelZ, bit7:AccX,"
" bit8:AccY, bit9:AccZ, bit11:yaw, bit12:yaw rate"
msgstr ""
"bit1:PosX, bit2:PosY, bit3:PosZ, bit4:VelX, bit5:VelY, bit6:VelZ, bit7:AccX,"
" bit8:AccY, bit9:AccZ, bit11:偏航, bit12:偏航速率"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rover-commands.rst:63
#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rover-commands.rst:268
#: 351ffc69cd584cbd868805602e060243 e54c1e8639dd4bc8b5b495b65039ee7b
msgid ""
"When providing position or velocity both X and Y axis must be provided.  At "
"least one of position, velocity, yaw or yaw rate must be provided.  If "
"position is provided velocity, yaw and yaw rate are ignored. Acceleration is"
" not supported."
msgstr ""
"提供位置或速度时，X 轴和 Y 轴均须提供。位置、速度、偏航和偏航速率中至少须提供一项。若提供位置，则速度、偏航和偏航速率将被忽略。不支持加速度。"

